silm:instances_papers_01_orientation_chapters_14_kleisli_enrichment_pipeline_sections_05_glue_as_kleisli_arrow_concrete_anchor_3#vetcareplan77 a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.01_orientation.chapters.14_kleisli_enrichment_pipeline.sections.05_glue_as_kleisli_arrow.concrete_anchor_3#vetcareplan77" .
silm:instances_papers_01_orientation_chapters_14_kleisli_enrichment_pipeline_sections_05_glue_as_kleisli_arrow_concrete_anchor_3#vetcareplan77 silm:hasLongDescription "The VetCarePlan77 is VetCarePlan77 is a competing cocone target: a veterinary care plan object that also receives all ten typed legs through compatible arrows. Its existence is used to confirm that Mittens is the colimit: by JoC §11.3, there must be a unique mediating arrow u: Mittens -> VetCarePlan77. VetCarePlan77 is a valid apex but not the canonical one; Mittens is." .
